note src/turing/ty_core_lib.om -- Pure seeded OM-2 implementation of Turing Yield
note TY-1/TY-2 math, CTR1 reader, TYM0 context-table models, OMG0 companion
note records (ty_record + ty_profile), and continuous-value companion records
note & sidecar manifests (ty_qrecord).

