text t_ty_v0_name "TY measurement profile v0"
text t_ty_v0_dataset "crumbline exp-20260927-rep10 control trace.ctr seeds 1-10 per manifest; fit seeds 1-7; held-out seeds 8-10 scored once"
text t_ty_v0_xt "one outcome per CTR1 record, K=9: EXPAND pruned equiv/cost/frontier/step_cap, EXPAND unpruned failed/partial/improved, SUBMIT accept/reject"
text t_ty_v0_side "not coded, open to every model: op_index (SUBMIT=15), depth clipped at 7, crumb boundaries, crumb ordinal, event_index"
text t_ty_v0_reset "per crumb: previous-outcome features restart at event_index 0"
text t_ty_v0_est "ty.fit.kt16.mdl.v0: KT add-1/2 counts, 16-bit largest-remainder rows summing to 65536, floor 1/65536, row kept iff fit-data saving > row cost, unseen context uses the default order-0 row"
text t_ty_v0_lm "TYM0 v0 bitstream; L(M) = exact bits = 104 + 16(K-1) + rows x (keybits + 16(K-1))"
text t_ty_v0_brule "argmin validation DL (fit seeds 1-6, score seed 7) over order-0, order-1 (prev outcome), op-only; chosen order-1"
text t_ty_v0_crule "argmin validation DL over op + optional depth + previous outcomes 1..h, h = 1..5 (10 models); chosen op+prev1..4; refit on seeds 1-7"
text t_ty_v0_prule "PASS iff pooled T - qerr > margin_ub and, for each held-out seed with full L(B) and L(C) charged to it, T - qerr > 0; otherwise FAIL and STOP"
text t_ty_v0_eden "TY-7: T/J = T / E_C, E_C = idle-subtracted energy of scoring the held-out split with C alone; E_C - E_B not used (near zero or negative makes the ratio unbounded)"
text t_ty_v0_unit "micro-bits (1 T = 1 bit = 1000000 ub); model lengths in whole bits"

